  "description": "UNIQUE DESIGN, PINARELLO DNA… Pinarello introduces itself to the Gravel world for the first time and does it in a revolutionary way. GREVIL is designed and built to devour kilometers on any terrain while maintaining the Pinarello driving feeling but making versatility its strength. Possibility to travel classic 700c by 25mm wheels to be fast and powerful on the asphalt or to “dress” it with 42mm tires, to fly on dirt roads or muddy meadows; but it is also possible to use 650b wheels with tires up to 2.1” and GREVIL will have no more limits. GREVIL and contains the maximum expression of Pinarello know-how: the design of the rear stays allows a wheel passage up to 650bx2.1 \"or 700x42mm, E-Link integration for Shimano Di2, front fork with increased flap to protect the disc and aerodynamic optimization.",
